OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance gust 'toppled mum
OL,4,Aand broke her hip'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-three said she needed a hip
OL,7,Freplacement after powerful gusts from
OL,8,Fan air ambulance blew her off her feet.
OL,10,FGill said she was left in
OL,11,F"excruciating" pain after the freak
OL,12,Faccident outside her home in
OL,13,FSouthend-on-Sea.
OL,15,FThe 66-year-old said she had been
OL,16,Fexcited by the helicopter taking off
OL,17,Fnearby and was filming it when the
OL,18,Fforceful winds toppled her on 28
OL,19,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
