OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance gust 'toppled mum
OL,4,Aand broke her hip'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPilots at Essex & Herts Air Ambulance,
OL,7,Fwhich operated the aircraft, were
OL,8,Fissued with a reminder about the
OL,9,Fhazards associated with downwash
OL,10,Ffollowing the incident.
